<title>USA: Heartland Express sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Heartland Express sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>CORALVILLE, Iowa 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Heartland Express Inc said Thursday it will issue a stock dividend of 0.50 shares for each share owned on September 23.</p>
<p>The company will issue 10 million shares in the dividend, and cash will be paid in lieu of fractional shares.</p>
<p>The action will increase to 30 million from 20 million the number of issued and outstanding shares.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
